# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Logs and scratch (the region-profile log behind the report's Figure 6 is data)
*.log
!report/data/profile_regions.log

# Exported chat transcripts. Local record only - never committed. These contain the
# full session log including file contents and command output.
chats/

# Output of bench/run.py; the measured numbers live in report/data/.
bench/results/

# LaTeX build products of report/
report/*.aux
report/*.bbl
report/*.blg
report/*.out
report/*.toc
report/*.fdb_latexmk
report/*.fls
report/*.synctex.gz

# Kept on purpose (do not ignore):
#   weights/microgpt.bin   - lets a reviewer verify the golden values without training
#   data/*.txt             - the exact evaluation splits the numbers come from
#   input.txt              - the source corpus, so the repo reproduces offline
#   report/data/run_w_*.txt - the raw measurements behind every microgpt number
